      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北港火山举办了抽选制的送巧克力活动，\n打算借此和粉丝进行交流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ad55aa6313abd3c34bbe8fb343e2cda2720e1ef6d0b9bd8a9355e35c6d3002b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
