      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这该不会是……训练员你……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "393029ac16987c169a5d2f5445c937b4d534dfe59523adf06552b3a4290ed756",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38b0aaa4017c818cf7efe6fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我点头承认。\n这是我为了北港火山，\n悄悄事先做好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4809e9647a62dcfc8a3821a47ff750940dc051b01343831896a94db9573ba5b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e95d92704f9a034459589bca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……就在我思考着\n自己能为努力筹画情人节活动的\n北港火山做些什么时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40527bc303fe943a5283c21bebf48c4536abcdc821e9ec4dbec90d6ee4a408f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f480e37af12d8751b971391",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我想起今年新年时，\n吃了咖喱拉面后恢复活力的北港火山。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d20dbc3f68cb68c7709a990d7cf19b52eb8412b86c7e616c0111eb1b7370bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099107.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffaf6494d87e47568bf7de75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许只要接触到有苫小牧风味的东西，\n就能让北港火山感到疗愈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f271de79359b7fdb665b5d314ba996ef176017391a487e2ec94613f4b94f93a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
